sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant NextAPI as Next.js API<br/>/api/files/*
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPN as SPN Token Service
    participant DBFS as Databricks DBFS<br/>or Volumes API

    Note over Browser,DBFS: File Upload to Volumes (Full Auth Flow)
    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/files/upload<br/>multipart/form-data
    Note right of Browser: File: data.csv (5MB)<br/>Path: /Volumes/main/raw/uploads/

    Note over NextAPI,Okta: Step 1: Validate User Session
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth->>DB: Get Session + User + Org
    DB-->>Auth: Session Context { userId, orgId }
    opt Validate Okta Token
        Auth->>Okta: Verify user token
        Okta-->>Auth: Token valid
    end
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID

    Note over NextAPI,DBFS: Step 2: Get SPN Token
    NextAPI->>DB: Get Organization SPN Config
    DB-->>NextAPI: SPN clientId + encrypted secret
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN access token

    alt SPN Token Missing or Expired
        SPN->>SPN: Decrypt client secret
        SPN->>DBFS: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
        DBFS-->>SPN: Access Token (1hr TTL)
        SPN->>DB: Cache encrypted SPN token
    end

    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Bearer Token

    Note over NextAPI,DBFS: Step 3: Stream Upload to Databricks
    NextAPI->>DBFS: PUT /api/2.0/fs/files<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    DBFS-->>NextAPI: { path: "/Volumes/main/raw/uploads/data.csv" }

    opt Track Upload in Database
        NextAPI->>DB: INSERT file_metadata
        Note right of NextAPI: Store upload record for audit
    end

    NextAPI-->>Browser: { success: true, path: "..." }

    Note over Browser,DBFS: Large File Upload (Chunked) - SPN Token Cached
    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/files/upload/init
    Note right of Browser: File: large_dataset.parquet (500MB)

    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token (from cache)
    SPN-->>NextAPI: Cached SPN Token
    NextAPI->>DBFS: POST /api/2.0/fs/files (create handle)<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    DBFS-->>NextAPI: { handle: "abc123" }
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { uploadId: "abc123" }

    loop For Each Chunk (1MB each)
        Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/files/upload/chunk
        Note right of Browser: Chunk data + uploadId
        NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session (quick check)
        NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token (from cache)
        NextAPI->>DBFS: POST /api/2.0/fs/add-block<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
        DBFS-->>NextAPI: { success: true }
        NextAPI-->>Browser: { chunkIndex: N, success: true }
    end

    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/files/upload/complete
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
    NextAPI->>DBFS: POST /api/2.0/fs/close<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    DBFS-->>NextAPI: { path: "...", size: 500MB }
    NextAPI->>DB: UPDATE file_metadata (complete)
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { success: true, path: "..." }

    Note over Browser,DBFS: Download File
    Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/files/download?path=/Volumes/...
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Token
    NextAPI->>DBFS: GET /api/2.0/fs/files?path=...<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    DBFS-->>NextAPI: File Stream
    NextAPI-->>Browser: File Download (streamed)
